# Cross-cutting tests that span multiple components.
#
# Examples:
#   test_branding_consistency.py    — branding tokens used everywhere
#   test_no_hardcoded_paths.py      — no DP5520WMK / mk-uP5520 anywhere
#   test_imports_clean.py           — core never imports adapters
#   test_i18n_keys_complete.py      — all 7 langs have same keys
